<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S4.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 4 Experimental setup ‣ SwiftSolve: A Self-Iterative, Complexity-Aware Multi-Agent Framework for Competitive Programming" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Per-source breakdown.</span></a></li>
